The pre-4.1 password scramble in internal/mysqlwire/auth.go
(ScrambleOldPassword, PWHash and myRnd) follows the algorithm as implemented in
go-sql-driver/mysql, which is licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0:

    https://github.com/go-sql-driver/mysql

It is reimplemented here so the proxy can drive a raw net.Conn rather than a
database/sql connection. The MPL-2.0 is file-scoped; no go-sql-driver source is
vendored or linked.
